exit early if not notification daemon was found

will silence annoying notify-send: vfprintf %s NULL in "Using server %s %s, v%s - Supporting Notification Spec %s" messages in logs
also, one should check for API calls return values..
Index: tools/notify-send.c
--- tools/notify-send.c.orig
+++ tools/notify-send.c
@@ -393,10 +393,11 @@ main (int argc, char *argv[])
         if (!notify_init ("notify-send"))
                 exit (1);
 
-        notify_get_server_info (&server_name,
+        if (!notify_get_server_info (&server_name,
                                 &server_vendor,
                                 &server_version,
-                                &server_spec_version);
+                                &server_spec_version))
+                exit (1);
 
         g_debug ("Using server %s %s, v%s - Supporting Notification Spec %s",
                  server_name, server_vendor, server_version, server_spec_version);
